64,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a tragedy that Misaki was executed, but the results are in. Jonathan has been attacked. This is a devastating loss for the village, as we have lost our only source of confirmed information.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Rin,,Nooo! Not Jonathan! He was the Seer! That's so mean! The werewolf is super scary for doing that! Now what are we going to do? We have to find the wolf right now!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A truly efficient strike by the wolf. By removing the Seer, the adversary has plunged us back into a fog of uncertainty. We must now rely solely on our own deductions to survive.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Since Jonathan is gone, we must rely on the facts we have. Benjamin was confirmed human by the Seer. That leaves Rin and me. If we are to be logical, the wolf is one of us.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Rin,,"What?! Just me and Mizuki? But I'm a villager! I told you guys! If Benjamin is a good guy, then Mizuki must be the scary werewolf! You're trying to trick me with your logic!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Let us not let emotions cloud our judgment. While the logic seems binary, we must remember the possibility of a Possessed player. However, if we assume a standard distribution, the tension between you two is quite illuminating.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Rin, your panic is understandable, but accusations without evidence are not logic. Benjamin, you mentioned the Possessed; that is a crucial point. If one of us is the wolf, the other could be the Possessed or a villager.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Rin,,"Possessed? What's that? I don't care about that! I'm just a regular girl! Mizuki is the one acting all fancy with her words to confuse us! Benjamin, you're the smart one, tell her she's being suspicious!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"My dear Rin, while I appreciate your faith in my intellect, I cannot simply point a finger based on ""fancy words."" Mizuki's approach is consistent with her character. However, your desperation is becoming quite palpable.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Desperation is not a crime, Rin, but it is a poor substitute for proof. Benjamin, you are the only confirmed human left. I trust your objectivity. Let us decide who is the true threat before the night falls.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm not desperate, I'm just scared! But I'm not the wolf! Mizuki is just trying to make me look bad so she can win! Benjamin, please believe me! I'm just a villager! We have to vote for Mizuki!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The air is thick with desperation, is it not? Rin, your pleas are heartfelt, yet Mizuki's composure is almost too perfect. In this vacuum of evidence, I find myself weighing a frantic innocence against a calculated calm. A fascinating dilemma.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
